      "message": "Yes, here: https://skia.googlesource.com/skia.git/+/refs/heads/main/src/sksl/codegen/SkSLSPIRVCodeGenerator.cpp#5238\n\nThis informs the compiler to use the appropriate syntax for push constants v. UBOs. Theoretically once we are in SPIR-V land we already know we are using Vulkan, so if we know we are using graphite that we can always use push constant syntax, but the SPIR-V generation code is shared w/ ganesh which still sometimes opts to not use push constants. LMK if you\u0027re fine keeping this approach or if you have a different idea for how this should work.",
